This repository contains the source code necessary to run the assimilation system including the model runing job and the EnKF assimilation to correcte the model initial conditions.


It should be supported by other additional routines like the coupled HYCOM-CICE model developed at NERSC and the enkf code.

# Modifications

# 1)  introduce four ice parameters with random perturbation used in the TP5 reanalysis
# 2)  including the ML-based SIT observations in winter month before 2010.
# 3)  Increased the localization radisu from 200 km to 250 km after April 2000 in the TP5 reanalysis.
#     updated in spring of 2026 by JX on 22th April.



